  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Norwegian Centre for Human Rights 2017 - 2019</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Norwegian Centre for Human Rights 2017 - 2019. Capacity building and education within human rights for human rights defenders, civil society and academia in i.a. Indonesia, Vietnam and China in the areas of human rights education, rule of law, freedom of religion or belief, human rights and business, equality and non-discrimination, human rights mechanisms.</narrative>
  </description>
